# The -3's "for each opponent who didn't discard two nonland cards": Bot2 has cast seven Moxen on turn 2 and holds one card (a
# Mox Jet). It discards it (all it has) and has not discarded two nonland cards, so Bot1 draws a card: hand 3 Forests after
# turn 1, 4 after the turn-3 draw, 5. The control with two nonland cards discarded is
# garruk-veiled-butcher-minus-three-draws-nothing-when-two-nonland-cards-are-discarded.

